  "lyrics_timeline": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.0,
      "text": "(Guzheng plucking solo, eerie wind sound)",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 5.0,
      "end": 8.0,
      "text": "(Heavy 808 bass drop enters slowly)",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 13.0,
      "text": "Yeah. KAI ONYX. Look up. We taking over the night.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 23.0,
      "text": "穿著全黑的 Hoodie 走在長安街",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 25.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "text": "月光灑在地上 reflected on my J's",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 33.0,
      "text": "不需要通行證 I got the Master Key",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 38.0,
      "text": "系統偵測不到我像個 Ghost ID",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "他們還在爭奪那些地面的權力",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 45.0,
      "end": 48.0,
      "text": "我已經 Level Up 到了無人能及的天際",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 53.0,
      "text": "古老的城牆 lock 住誰的秘密",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "但在我的視角只是一場遊戲",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 63.0,
      "text": "警報聲在響 但我聽不到 只有心跳聲 在跟我訊號",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 73.0,
      "text": "They trying to catch me riding dirty 但我的flow像水一樣 sturdy",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 83.0,
      "text": "Forbidden Night, 紫禁夜行 只有強者才配擁有這個夜景",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 90.0,
      "end": 93.0,
      "text": "History 重寫, I'm the new King 打破了規則, hear the alarm ring",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 100.0,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "紫禁夜行, no mercy, no grace 穿梭在宮牆外, leave no trace",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "從古代到未來, I run this place KAI ONYX legacy, watch me ace.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 123.0,
      "text": "(Sound of sword unsheathing: Schwing) (Heavy 808 slide solo with glass shatter samples)",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 138.0,
      "text": "這是 Drill but make it graceful 像書法運筆一樣 faithful",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 145.0,
      "end": 148.0,
      "text": "每一句歌詞都是照書 聽不懂的人只能叫輸",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 155.0,
      "end": 158.0,
      "text": "Jade around my neck, 冷冰冰的玉 Heart of fire, 熱騰騰的氣",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 165.0,
      "end": 168.0,
      "text": "不要問我這裡是不是禁區 For me, everywhere is VIP.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 175.0,
      "end": 178.0,
      "text": "紅牆黃瓦 霓虹大廈 過去現在 在此交叉 I see it all.",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 190.0,
      "end": 193.0,
      "text": "[Genre Switch: Jersey Club 142BPM] KAI ONYX in the house! 紫禁城 in the house!",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 210.0,
      "end": 213.0,
      "text": "From 0 to 100, real quick 整個紫禁城都在看這部 flick",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 225.0,
      "end": 228.0,
      "text": "歷史課本會記住我的 name KAI ONYX, remember the flame",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 240.0,
      "end": 243.0,
      "text": "Forbidden Night, 紫禁夜行 只有強者才配擁有這個夜景",
      "words": []
    },
    {
      "start": 255.0,
      "end": 258.0,
      "text": "(Guzheng fades out with police sirens and rain sounds)",
      "words": []
    }
  ]
